MASTER PROMPT: MEDMIT AI — FULL-STACK AI HEALTHCARE PLATFORM
1. Project Objective
Upgrade my existing Medmit AI application into a fully functional, multilingual, AI-powered healthcare platform.
IMPORTANT: First inspect the entire existing codebase, frontend, backend, database, authentication, API integrations, Report Scanner, AI Copilot, Wellness Dashboard, doctor modules, and existing UI.
Do not rebuild the application from scratch. Preserve existing features and design. Implement the requested functionality inside the current architecture.
Use real database persistence, real API integrations, reliable processing, proper error handling, and end-to-end testing. Do not create buttons that only look functional or features that use hardcoded data while claiming to be live.
If an external API, service credential, professional verification source, or payment integration is unavailable, implement the working components that can be completed, provide a clearly labelled demo or pending state, and document the exact remaining configuration.
